Depends: bash, awk, sed, acl, sysstat, setpriv | util-linux (>= 2.33), zstd, lsb-release, idn2, jq, bubblewrap, at, gnupg
Breaks: hostisan-web-terminal (<< 1:2.0.0)
Description: Hostisan control panel
 Hostisan is an open source web hosting control panel: web, DNS, mail,
 databases, backups and cron for many users on one server.
 This package holds the panel (the hostisan binary with its web UI) and the
 command line scripts it runs.
